 "manufacturer": "Zhuhai Hongjiacheng Technology",
 "title": "SS32C to SS320C: 3 A Schottky barrier rectifiers, 20 V to 200 V, in SMC (DO-214AB)",
 "source": {
  "revision": "Rev:2.0",
  "pages": 3
 },
 "summary": "A family of nine single Schottky barrier rectifiers in the SMC (DO-214AB) surface-mount case, with peak reverse ratings from 20 V (SS32C) to 200 V (SS320C). All carry 3.0 A average forward current and take an 80 A single half-sine surge. SS310C is the 100 V type: at most 0.85 V forward drop at 3 A and 0.05 mA leakage at rated voltage and 25 °C. Intended uses are freewheeling, polarity protection, DC/DC converters and inverters running at high frequency from low voltages.",
